      "value": null,
      "type": "∀ {G : Type u_1} [inst : AddCommGroup G] {m : ℕ},\n  m ≥ 2 →\n    (∀ (x : G), m • x = 0) →\n      ∀ {A : Set G},\n        A.Finite →\n          ∀ {K : ℝ},\n            A.Nonempty →\n              ↑(Nat.card ↑(A + A)) ≤ K * ↑A.ncard →\n                ∃ H c,\n                  c.Finite ∧\n                    (↑H).Finite ∧ ↑(Nat.card ↑c) < ↑m * K ^ (256 * m ^ 3 + 1) ∧ (↑H).ncard ≤ A.ncard ∧ A ⊆ c + ↑H",
      "source_range": {
        "start_line": 971,
        "start_column": 0,
        "end_line": 1076,
        "end_column": 30
      },
      "proof_valued": true,
      "projection": false,
      "private": false,
      "module": "Main",
      "kind": "theorem",
      "internal": false,
      "id": "torsion_PFR",
      "generated_kind": null,
      "external": false,
      "docstring": "Suppose that $G$ is an abelian group of torsion $m$ (not necessarily finite).\nIf $A \\subset G$ is a finite non-empty set with $|A+A| \\leq K|A|$, then $A$ can be covered by at\nmost $m K^{256 m^3+1}$ translates of a finite subspace $H$ of $G$ with $|H| \\leq |A|$. "
    },
